; ============================================================
; TITLE:    Confetti Party
; CATEGORY: Generative Art & Colour
; LEVEL:    Beginner
; TAGS:     random, color, DOT, rectangles, party
; SUMMARY:  Throws hundreds of colorful dots and paper strips across the screen at random.
; ============================================================
;
; WHAT IT DOES
;   Scatters round dots and little twisted paper strips everywhere,
;   in bright party colors. Every run is different because the
;   positions, sizes, colors and angles are all chosen at random.
;
; HOW TO USE
;   Press Run again and again. Each time you get a new party.
;
; CONCEPTS YOU WILL LEARN
;   * RANDOM to pick numbers, and (RANDOM low high) for a range
;   * PICK to choose a random item from a list
;   * DOT with a thick pen for round shapes
;   * FILLED for small rotated rectangles
;
; THINGS TO TRY
;   * Use only gold and silver colors for a fancy party.
;   * Make 1000 dots instead of 300.
;   * Use a black background. Do the colors look brighter?
; ============================================================

; The party colors, as [red green blue] lists.
make "party [[255 70 90] [255 200 40] [60 200 120] [60 150 255]
             [180 90 230] [255 130 40] [240 90 200] [40 210 220]]

; JUMP lifts the pen and goes to a random place on the screen.
to jump
  penup
  setxy (random -390 390) (random -290 290)
end

; ROUND.ONE drops one round piece of confetti.
to round.one
  jump
  setpencolor pick :party
  setpensize (random 4 14)
  dot pos
end

; STRIP drops one paper strip, turned at a random angle.
to strip
  jump
  setheading random 360
  filled pick :party [
    repeat 2 [forward 16 right 90 forward 6 right 90]
  ]
end

clearscreen hideturtle
setbackground [255 250 240]
repeat 300 [round.one]
repeat 150 [strip]
